      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Who We Are & How We Help"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h1",
      "text": "A Message from Our CEO"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Thank you for expressing interest in Marina Harbor Detox (MHD). We understand what you are going through as we too have experienced years of substance dependency. Only after numerous failed attempts at treatment did we find hope and recovery which were the catalysts for the birth of MHD."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "At the heart of the recovery process is an initial, personalized evaluation by our team of experienced physicians, psychologists in the field of addiction. Please take a moment and read their resumes under Team. We believe it is their expertise which sets us apart from other facilities."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Because you are a unique individual, so too is your physiological response to substance use and the need to tailor fit a comprehensive treatment plan to meet your immediate needs and long term goals. This will include a complete history of your substance consumption from first to last, your current state of health, as well as prescribed medication for a safe and comfortable detox. In consultation with our physicians, the length of your stay at MHD will vary depending on the length and severity of your addiction and your overall health."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Our facility will provide you with 24/7 medical personnel and a private room with bath. Marina Harbor Detox also provides individualized meals, room & laundry services, and yoga. We encourage and promote walks along the Golden Gate Promenade, in addition to yoga, reiki and other routines, to help restore physical and emotional well-being."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Dedicated Team"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h4",
      "text": "Marina Harbor Detox is a private, luxury, professional drug detox and alcohol detox facility located on Marina Boulevard in San Francisco. Our expert team has combined decades of experience treating drug and alcohol abuse."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Stories of Hope in Recovery"
    }
  ],
